	<description> Even the darkest secrets can’t stay buried forever…  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;b&gt;Five figures gather round a shallow grave. They had all taken turns to dig. An adult sized hole would have taken longer. An innocent life had been taken but the pact had been made. Their secrets would be buried, bound in blood …&lt;/b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Years later, a headmistress is found brutally murdered, the first in a spate of gruesome killings which shock the Black Country.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;But when human remains are discovered at a former children’s home, disturbing secrets are also unearthed. &lt;b&gt;D.I. Kim Stone&lt;/b&gt; fast realises she’s on the hunt for a twisted individual whose killing spree spans decades.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;As the body count rises, Kim needs to stop the murderer before they strike again. But to catch the killer, can Kim confront the demons of her own past before it’s too late?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
